              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Template inventory scanner parses an unbounded local corpus\n\nThe industrial-safety inventory recursively materializes the full source tree and opens XLSX, PDF, image, and ZIP parsers without file-count, aggregate-byte, elapsed-time, or symlink admission.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion unbounded template inventory\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400, CWE-200\n\nRemediation:\nApply no-follow traversal, file-count and aggregate-byte budgets before parser initialization, per-file size/type limits, elapsed deadlines, and bounded metadata output."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:dd6968c68e480d406fa74a1cd6a00d2768f36ea47a6792ef6785e803e548fd97"
          },
          "properties": {
