              }
            }
          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "SIF approval preflight can skip migration scope validation\n\nThe SIF embedding approval preflight accepts an arbitrary migration path, but checks forbidden non-SIF objects only when the filename contains sif-embedding-only; other filenames receive a passing scope result.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Approval integrity sif migration scope bypass\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-20, CWE-807\n\nRemediation:\nValidate an allowlisted SQL object grammar for every migration path and bind the packet to the exact expected migration digest, independent of filename."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:3a4c96cefe6094640edc23804346c3b6965a991140f8f6ca6ef80b2cddb39015"
          },
