          "message": {
            "text": "Export smoke chain accepts unbounded responses and lacks subprocess deadlines\n\nOperator smoke helpers fully materialize HTTP responses and invoke Chrome or child processes without byte ceilings, AbortSignals, or process deadlines.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion unbounded export smoke harness\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nAdd HTTP deadlines and streaming byte ceilings, process timeouts and termination, and guaranteed temporary-profile cleanup."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:5b0e4866fe383e93453bf6571b0b3ce54d57f2313a6a594aa49356b7fe0f60ff"
