          "message": {
            "text": "Legacy document and query tables lack row-level security\n\nMigration 001 creates documents and query_logs without RLS; direct Data API access can cross tenant boundaries if deployed grants expose them.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization bypass missing row level security\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nApproval-gated: enable and force RLS, add tenant ownership or retire the tables, revoke unnecessary grants, and verify direct-role denial."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:4b69ea8a5613550aa39ead853f5fe43a11b1af6844229f67ecf691e1c664f2dc"
