          ],
          "message": {
            "text": "Dry-run publication can commit and push pre-existing changes\n\nThe publication script stages broad fixed paths without checking a clean tree or expected diff, then may commit and subtree-push those pre-existing changes when an environment flag is set.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Supply chain unbound publication diff\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-494, CWE-829\n\nRemediation:\nRequire a clean starting tree, pin expected HEAD/branch/remote, stage only generated artifacts whose digests are recorded, show the exact diff, and require a separate explicit push approval."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:0ba14040c012bd1f24282ebb2a9dce0a3d466c0130ae87de4cf020025919f4ac"
