          "message": {
            "text": "Public catalog RLS exposes raw safety-reference, ontology, and ingestion metadata\n\nPublic SELECT policies expose raw safety-reference and ingestion records; ontology edges can also reveal relationships whose endpoint publication state is not required.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Information exposure raw corpus\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-200, CWE-862\n\nRemediation:\nApproval-gated: replace raw-table public SELECT with minimal views or RPCs, require published endpoint nodes for graph edges, and revoke underlying anonymous grants."
