          "message": {
            "text": "NULL-tenant dispatch rows bypass owner-scoped RLS\n\nThe dispatch table permits NULL organization_id values and its owner FOR ALL policy explicitly accepts them, creating tenantless rows outside ordinary ownership.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Authorization bypass null tenant policy\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-862, CWE-639\n\nRemediation:\nApproval-gated: make organization_id non-null, backfill or quarantine legacy rows, replace the NULL branch with strict tenant ownership, and verify direct-role denial."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
