          "message": {
            "text": "Workspace provisioning can create duplicate organizations and sites\n\nDefault workspace provisioning performs lookup and insert as separate operations; concurrent first-use requests can create duplicate organizations or sites before either sees the other.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Race condition workspace provisioning\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-362\n\nRemediation:\nAdd deterministic idempotency keys and database uniqueness, then provision through one transaction or conflict-safe upsert."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:307737b122dd051f80aed971fe1353b1ad0537ba5344df68ef97a10ab4d98648"
