          "message": {
            "text": "Archive and spreadsheet budgets run after expensive parser initialization\n\nAdmZip and ExcelJS parse or materialize attacker-influenced archives and workbooks before entry, expansion, row, cell, and elapsed limits are checked; the HWPX anonymizer has the same ordering.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Resource exhaustion late parser admission\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-400\n\nRemediation:\nRun bounded ZIP central-directory and file-size preflight before parser construction; use streaming or sandboxed workbook parsing with hard process memory/time limits."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:d2eb0393bf1b896cf1e7dcbf866abdeab6a28db9ab735a3623b0ef848f280ca7"
