          "message": {
            "text": "Related object identifiers are not bound to the same tenant\n\nIndependent foreign keys allow organization, site, workpack, worker, photo, Share, and acknowledgement identifiers from different tenants to coexist; selected application routes compensate but the schema does not enforce the tuple invariant.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Authorization bypass cross tenant reference\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-639\n\nRemediation:\nApproval-gated: add composite tenant-scoped keys or constraint triggers, migrate inconsistent rows, and retain application tuple checks as defense in depth."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
