          "message": {
            "text": "Distributed admission trusts an unverified forwarded IP header\n\nx-vercel-forwarded-for is accepted before the code establishes that the request traversed a trusted Vercel proxy, and the resulting value becomes the per-client distributed admission key.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Rate limit bypass untrusted forwarded identity\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-345\n\nRemediation:\nOnly trust Vercel forwarding headers when the deployment context is verified; otherwise derive identity from a trusted ingress or collapse to a conservative anonymous bucket."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "codexSecurity/v1": "codex-security/v1:sha256:f3fc04d38111cfb2a828a0e7419d5d0fd0d6f13bbbb0e2f119b97bcf6c7c1ab6"
