          "message": {
            "text": "Concurrent worker imports can bypass the site-transfer check\n\nWorker import checks existing site bindings and then performs a separate upsert, allowing concurrent requests to pass the check and race a worker into a different site.\n\nSeverity: medium\n\nCategory: Race condition worker site binding\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-362, CWE-639\n\nRemediation:\nMove the site-transfer invariant into an atomic database function or constraint-backed transaction and test concurrent imports for one organization/external key."
          },
          "partialFingerprints": {
