          "message": {
            "text": "API error responses expose internal database and provider details\n\nA public knowledge route and several authenticated routes project raw exception, database, webhook response-body, or vision-provider details into client responses.\n\nSeverity: low\n\nCategory: Information exposure raw error projection\n\nWeaknesses: CWE-209\n\nRemediation:\nReturn stable public error codes and generic messages, log detailed causes server-side with redaction, and add regression tests for representative provider and database failures."
