                "text": "Resource exhaustion: Export cancellation gap. Categories: Resource exhaustion export cancellation gap. Weaknesses: CWE-400.\n\nRemediation:\n\nPropagate request.signal, wrap rendering in a deadline shorter than the lease, abort worker processes, and keep the lease alive until termination is confirmed."
